# About me

I am a computational linguist and postdoctoral researcher at the [CoAStaL NLP
group][] at the [University of Copenhagen][KU].  My research interests include
corpus linguistics, (semi-)automatic annotation, processing of non-standard
language varieties, and natural language generation.

Previously, I worked in various research projects related to [computational
historical linguistics][comphist] supervised by [Stefanie Dipper][].


